      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I verify that a mover in Chakan is IBA approved?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Visit the Indian Banks Association website or request the mover’s IBA approval certificate. Reputable Packers And Movers In Chakan will display the IBA seal on their office, website, and official documents. Cross‑check the certificate number with the IBA database for authenticity before booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for shifting a house from Chakan to a major transport hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid government‑issued ID, the original GSTIN certificate of the mover, a signed packing list, an e‑Way bill generated for the cargo, and any special permits for oversized items. Providing these ensures smooth check‑post clearance and compliance with transport regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the flat‑rate residential moving cost calculated for a Chakan relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The flat rate combines the total volume of household goods (measured in cubic feet), distance to the destination hub, type of vehicle required, and any additional services such as packing or insurance. Packers And Movers In Chakan use a transparent matrix that adds a fixed fuel surcharge and GST to the base price.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment live while it travels from Chakan to the destination hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All Shree Ashirwad trucks are equipped with satellite GPS that feeds real‑time location data to a customer portal and mobile app. Once your goods are loaded, you’ll receive a tracking link that shows the exact position, estimated arrival time, and any checkpoint updates.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Which items need custom wooden crates in the 7‑layer protective packaging system?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">High‑value or fragile items such as glassware, antique furniture, temple idols, large electronic appliances, and delicate artworks are placed in custom‑built wooden crates. The crates are reinforced with high‑tensile ratchet lashings and fit within the 7‑layer bubble‑foam‑corrugated sandwich for maximum shock absorption.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the process for filing an insurance claim if damage occurs during the Chakan move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Immediately report the damage to the moving team and document it with photos. Submit a claim form along with the original invoice, insurance policy number, and proof of value. Shree Ashirwad’s IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance processes claims within 7‑10 business days, offering full reimbursement for verified losses.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on moving two‑wheelers through Chakan’s checkposts?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Two‑wheelers can be transported, but they must be secured on dedicated carriers with wheel chocks and ratchet lashings. Certain checkposts may require a separate permit for motorbikes, and the vehicle must be empty of fuel beyond 15 % to meet safety norms. Packers And Movers In Chakan handle all paperwork to avoid delays.</p>
      </div>
